1
00:00:00,457 --> 00:00:03,697
(Penny:)You know, I'm very proud of you
for trying to live with Amy.

2
00:00:03,760 --> 00:00:04,930
- Oh. Thank you.
- Mm.

3
00:00:04,995 --> 00:00:07,065
(Sheldon:)Of course, the ideal way
to conduct this experiment

4
00:00:07,130 --> 00:00:10,530
(Sheldon:)would be with four pairs of
identical Sheldons and Amys.

5
00:00:10,600 --> 00:00:13,240
(Sheldon:)One pair that was neither
dating nor living together.

6
00:00:13,303 --> 00:00:15,433
(Sheldon:)One pair that was dating
but not living together.

7
00:00:15,505 --> 00:00:17,145
(Sheldon:)One pair that was living
together but not dating.

8
00:00:17,173 --> 00:00:18,293
(Sheldon:)And then, of
course, one pair

9
00:00:18,341 --> 00:00:20,241
(Sheldon:)that was living
together and dating.

10
00:00:20,310 --> 00:00:21,640
(Sheldon:)Although, with
that many Sheldons,

11
00:00:21,711 --> 00:00:24,281
(Sheldon:)it'd be such a party,
we'd never get anything done.

12
00:00:24,347 --> 00:00:26,687
(Penny:)That was a cute story.

13
00:00:26,750 --> 00:00:28,550
(Penny:)So, um...

14
00:00:30,186 --> 00:00:31,486
(Penny:)What did you want to ask me?

15
00:00:31,554 --> 00:00:34,724
(Sheldon:)Well, you've lived with your
significant other for some time.

16
00:00:34,791 --> 00:00:36,761
(Sheldon:)I would like this
experiment to go well.

17
00:00:36,826 --> 00:00:39,496
(Sheldon:)Are there any insights
you can share?

18
00:00:39,562 --> 00:00:42,962
(Penny:)Mm. Well, the biggie is,
if she has an insane roommate,

19
00:00:43,033 --> 00:00:44,833
(Penny:)kick him out
as soon as possible.

20
00:00:44,901 --> 00:00:47,801
(Sheldon:)You know, Leonard
and I were very happy

21
00:00:47,871 --> 00:00:49,601
(Sheldon:)before you came along.

22
00:00:51,207 --> 00:00:53,047
(Amy:)You've been roommates
with Sheldon forever.

23
00:00:53,109 --> 00:00:55,179
(Amy:)Do you have any advice?

24
00:00:55,245 --> 00:00:57,375
(Leonard:)I'm trying to think of an answer

25
00:00:57,447 --> 00:01:01,027
(Leonard:)that won't stop you
from doing this.

